\chapter*{About this manual}
This manual is typeset with the \texttt{dfg-crc} class itself. Executable
examples show their source on the left and the rendered result on the right.
Wide tables and plots put the result below the code. All examples use the
fictional people, institutions, and projects embedded in the DTX.

Setup fragments, shell commands, and bibliography source records are shown
as code only. Complete proposal and CV examples follow the user guide, before the
implementation reference; see Chapters~\ref{chap:complete-example-proposal}
and~\ref{chap:complete-example-cv}.

\blockcquote[195]{Hoare1973}{Documentation must be regarded as an integral part of the process of design and coding.}

