\subsection{Finances: previous funding and new requests}
\label{sec:manual-requested-finances}
The next table combines five historical rows with the current requests declared
in the funding examples. Its new-period amounts include the earlier |A02|
requests, the equipment records below, and the complete |A06| request in
Section~\ref{sec:manual-project-funding}. These records are collected from the
auxiliary file even when their declarations follow the overview. All input
amounts are full EUR; do not duplicate a project declaration to populate this
overview.

\begin{dfgExample}[label={ex:manual-previous-funding-and-current-requests-across-all-five-groups},dfg wide,listing above* text]{Previous funding and current requests across all five groups}
\addEntry[funding]{PreviousRequestedFunding}{
