\begin{docKey}{thumbindex}{\docKeyChoices{true,false}}{initially \texttt{true}}
  Shows a thumbindex in the outer margin. This can be customized further.
\end{docKey}


Customize further all about the thumbindex. Modification done in
\dfgFile{dfg-customization}.
\begin{docKey}{thumbindex@pattern}{=\meta{int}}{initially \texttt{10}}
  Define how long the pattern of the \refKey{thumbindex} is until it starts again from
