  \texttt{frametext-highlight} selects complete entries instead. Each keyword
  applies only to its corresponding bibliography context.
  This setting is independent of \refKey{emphasizeAuthors},
  which controls name highlighting.  A \texttt{B06-project} keyword alone does
  not trigger bold type.  To show only the keyword-selected full entries in
  bold, use \texttt{emphasizeAuthors=false} together with
  \texttt{emphasizeEntries=true}.
\end{docKey}

